WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.488
An idiom carries a meaning beyond the literal words, so context matters.

00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:08.695
What does “lend a hand” usually mean? Answer: Help someone

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:13.715
Discuss three everyday idioms and explain their meanings in your own words.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:16.667
Discuss why: The idiom means help.
